# ── OS / noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.log
/tmp/

# ── NEVER COMMIT: real people's data ────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is (for now) publicly served via GitHub Pages. Everything below
# contains real names, real personal email addresses, meeting audio, private
# photos and video of team members' homes. None of it belongs in version
# control. Keep this block at the top of any future edits to this file.
WhatsApp Chat*/
6 Degrees Meeting/
# Media anywhere EXCEPT a deliberate site-asset folder (see negation below).
*.opus
*.m4a
*.mp4
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.gif
*.webp

# Deliberate, reviewed site assets (logo etc.) are allowed here and ONLY here.
!assets/
!assets/**

# Meeting/planning documents (contain real names and personal details)
*.docx
*.pptx
6 Degrees Meeting Agenda.pdf
6Degrees Mtg Slides.pdf
6-Degrees-Guide.pdf

# Working drafts not part of the deployed site
6degrees_enrollment_form.html

# ── Supabase ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets NEVER belong in this repo. The project URL and anon key are public by
# design (they ship to every browser and are protected by RLS); the service_role
# key and DB password bypass RLS entirely and must stay local.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
**/service_role*
**/*secret*
